<title>USA: U.S. copper rod sales, output rise in January.</title>
<headline>U.S. copper rod sales, output rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. copper rod receipts in January rose to 384,341,000 pounds, up from 353,656,000 pounds in December, the American Bureau of Metal Statistics reported.</p>
<p>Rod production in January totaled 372,740,000 pounds, up from 328,129,000 pounds in December.</p>
<p>Rod shipments in January rose to 409,692,000 pounds from 354,297,000 pounds in December.</p>
<p>Rod inventory at the end of January was 122,374,000 pounds, down from 148,766,000 pounds in December.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
